      <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194508_636837_32274"/>
      <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194103_152524_29119"/>
      <ownedEnd xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194508_636837_32274" xmi:uuid="3fdc454f-88e6-43fd-9e29-9a356b721f4e" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193275_475364_23890"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193714_824977_27136"/>
      </ownedEnd>
    </packagedElement>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193678_42781_26866" xmi:uuid="38b545fd-7c1f-4f0c-82f0-3031c21fb7bb" xmi:type="uml:Association">
      <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194482_800140_32045"/>
      <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194011_416684_28708"/>
      <ownedEnd xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194482_800140_32045" xmi:uuid="1f5fa3c2-d6ba-41da-bd47-1b3e7e0f4248" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193222_666164_23810"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417195018_595082_37317" xmi:uuid="8bb260b6-7948-467d-b6fd-7b030deafa7e" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193678_42781_26866"/>
      </ownedEnd>
    </packagedElement>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412" xmi:uuid="39acd07e-4796-4027-a6d7-015af2217cb8" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455733289764_370626_43321" xmi:uuid="e03195c9-e4be-471e-9a06-0cf11d9dc5d2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <body>An AxisPlacement is a type of DetailedGeometricModelItem that defines a right-handed, 2D or 3D, local coordinate system within the main coordinate system provided by the enclosing GeometricCoordinateSpace. The first direction for the local x-axis is defined by the attribute RefDirection. If this attribute is not defined, then the default value is the same as the x-axis of the global coordinate system. The second direction of the local coordinate system is perpendicular to the first direction. The optional third direction for the local z-axis is defined by the attribute RefDirection. If this attribute is not defined, then the default value is the same as the z-axis of the global coordinate system. In the 3D case the second direction of the local y-axes is defined by the vector product of z- and x-direction. An externally defined AxisPlacement shall have all three attributes Axis, Position and RefDirection undefined, in which case these attributes have to be taken from the External object. &lt;note&gt;The order is important. The "vector product of x- and z-direction would only provide the inverse y-direction.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>AxisPlacement</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325082659_688993_42460" xmi:uuid="19e3a9b9-c553-44df-b08b-74671fdf34cb" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671446160826_484148_162891" xmi:uuid="2460c618-dae0-4892-be3e-cdba153255af" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671446169791_286685_162892" xmi:uuid="73301ee9-573a-4221-aa2a-e490222da390" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>WR1: SIZEOF(RefDirection) = SIZEOF(Position);</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>EXPRESS</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325348945_751887_42462" xmi:uuid="2c3b4dc6-458e-4757-9660-fb7bad190b22" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325082659_688993_42460"/>
          <body> if RefDirection is defined, its dimensionality shall be the same than the dimensionality of Position.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943680_235007_151478" xmi:uuid="df2de9c8-08ad-4c7e-b301-421cb872e2c4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943680_718572_151479" xmi:uuid="0f0ef7df-06de-4aba-bca1-d9ad6fea62db" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//RepresentationItem[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='AxisPlacement']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(RefDirection) or (count(tokenize(normalize-space(RefDirection), ' '))= count(tokenize(normalize-space(Position), ' ')))"&gt; (AxisPlacement_WR1 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) if RefDirection is defined, its dimensionality shall be the same than the dimensionality of Position.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1509023270410_282668_30084" xmi:uuid="cb9bcacb-1a8d-4392-bb08-313adb7baffc" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>(self.RefDirection-&gt;size() &gt; 0) implies (self.RefDirection-&gt;size() = self.Position-&gt;size())</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193399_376746_24804" xmi:uuid="2cfd6823-8c44-421c-94e1-70695fc83e91" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1516182257985_854636_74398" xmi:uuid="2ae5df5c-6e3f-467a-a98c-541296e0deb0" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193399_376746_24804"/>
          <body>if RefDirection is defined, its dimensionality shall be 2 or 3.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943646_811260_151470" xmi:uuid="9317f1ac-1c07-417e-9481-def57e6b6bb7" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943647_238077_151471" xmi:uuid="3cace66e-1254-43cb-bc26-e47e918afdea" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//RepresentationItem[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='AxisPlacement']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(RefDirection) or (count(tokenize(normalize-space(RefDirection), ' '))=2) or (count(tokenize(normalize-space(RefDirection), ' '))=3)"&gt; (AxisPlacement_RefDirectionLowerBound &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) if RefDirection is defined, its dimensionality shall be 2 or 3.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RefDirectionLowerBound</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194234_144900_30101" xmi:uuid="c1b0798e-8a15-4008-ad90-1e49266737d6" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>RefDirection-&gt;isEmpty () xor (RefDirection-&gt;size () &gt;= 2)</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1548167014649_896215_294950" xmi:uuid="2e307348-e361-41ca-84ef-18f4dad9db89" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1548167271422_380143_294952" xmi:uuid="8480a5ac-a79d-48be-a82e-d3435f2a0dc4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1548167014649_896215_294950"/>
          <body>the attribute Axis shall be unset in the 2D case because it defines the z-Direction of the local coordinate system. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943688_465092_151480" xmi:uuid="c971e38d-8c5f-4de0-8db0-1f332bd1e5b7" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943689_215909_151481" xmi:uuid="1dda6b49-a26a-44b3-823f-af3a63fcd294" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//RepresentationItem[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='AxisPlacement']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(count(tokenize(normalize-space(Position), ' '))=2) or not(Axis)"&gt; (AxisPlacement_NoAxisDefinedFor2DAxisPlacement &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) the attribute Axis shall be unset in the 2D case because it defines the z-Direction of the local coordinate system.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>NoAxisDefinedFor2DAxisPlacement</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1548167014651_747852_294951" xmi:uuid="618af18b-e3a2-4d44-986a-d91a0db63451" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>(self.Position-&gt;size() = 2) implies (self.Axis-&gt;isEmpty())</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932651_142094_163278" xmi:uuid="608ab386-d169-4a6a-b67b-ba2e5bfbe1a6" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943656_815735_151472" xmi:uuid="4b3ec6fb-bcc6-4f33-8f94-4c7fa2aec531" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943656_658782_151473" xmi:uuid="2a8f4f6a-d645-4f0f-9363-f17abb21fdbc" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//RepresentationItem[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='AxisPlacement']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(Position) or count(tokenize(normalize-space(Position), ' '))= 2 or count(tokenize(normalize-space(Position), ' '))=3"&gt; (AxisPlacement_WR3 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) Position shall be either undefined or its size shall be 2 or 3.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932657_652708_163281" xmi:uuid="6ad8513d-8b4b-442d-9504-430854759999" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932651_142094_163278"/>
          <body>Position shall be either undefined or its size shall be 2 or 3.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR3</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932656_902728_163280" xmi:uuid="fefe6e88-6af8-4156-a67e-c3a5cc360acb" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Position-&gt;isEmpty() xor (Position-&gt;size() &gt;= 2)</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932655_662703_163279" xmi:uuid="8050d8ef-cfde-4c2e-a4ba-e0a33e7dc7cb" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932657_846463_163283" xmi:uuid="66fc111f-563d-4dac-881c-98bd1d376eb5" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932655_662703_163279"/>
          <body>an AxisPlacement shall be either externally or locally defined.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943664_278318_151474" xmi:uuid="9bbe2c06-cedf-4dd9-a842-30d203df9205" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943664_745788_151475" xmi:uuid="6c78c50c-04d7-4e1b-8720-dfd8c40aee42" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//RepresentationItem[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='AxisPlacement']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="External and not(Position) or not(External) and Position"&gt; (AxisPlacement_WR4 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) an AxisPlacement shall be either externally or locally defined.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR4</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1673259932657_588658_163282" xmi:uuid="4f2b77fe-4c4f-4fbe-9c77-ba6e0b426a9f" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Position-&gt;isEmpty() xor self.External-&gt;isEmpty()</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193399_47594_24803" xmi:uuid="93bb14f9-d56b-4cd0-96f8-91dbd247a9e7" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1516182212539_637299_74395" xmi:uuid="cd1cbe06-a797-4976-b4be-423b41edb481" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193399_47594_24803"/>
          <body>if Axis is defined, its dimensionality shall be 3.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943673_656800_151476" xmi:uuid="e5df69ec-3aeb-4d23-9a26-acf7995f84b9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943673_777468_151477" xmi:uuid="95d8feb0-c012-47be-8fc1-10006e20558b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//RepresentationItem[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='AxisPlacement']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(Axis) or count(tokenize(normalize-space(Axis), ' '))=3"&gt; (AxisPlacement_AxisLowerBound &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) if Axis is defined, its dimensionality shall be 3.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>AxisLowerBound</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194233_574044_30100" xmi:uuid="99f58dad-dbfd-4931-9103-819babd0dd90" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>Axis-&gt;isEmpty() xor (Axis-&gt;size() = 3)</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325360409_788525_42463" xmi:uuid="c467e55f-4eeb-45fa-b008-0d3b03a6b0c4" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325415766_732034_42465" xmi:uuid="57ad9cf8-eb13-4c54-ad34-1202cd50437f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459325360409_788525_42463"/>
          <body>if Axis is defined, its dimensionality and the dimensionality of Position shall be 3.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671446190255_473151_162899" xmi:uuid="e1e71407-79ca-4c7e-a48c-886823540826" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671446197874_858879_162900" xmi:uuid="f39149ff-88df-49b9-be41-1e5da2dc04fe" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>WR2: NOT(EXISTS(Axis)) OR (SIZEOF(Axis) = SIZEOF(Position));</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>EXPRESS</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943638_528134_151468" xmi:uuid="e5068546-0d3b-4769-8a53-0ff75a3be40a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714741943638_868025_151469" xmi:uuid="6797ef16-3185-462d-be47-2e4d31cb43f9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//RepresentationItem[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='AxisPlacement']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(Axis) or (count(tokenize(normalize-space(Axis), ' '))= 3 and count(tokenize(normalize-space(Position), ' '))=3)"&gt; (AxisPlacement_WR2 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) if Axis is defined, its dimensionality and the dimensionality of Position shall be 3.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR2</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193025_577371_23412"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1509024049321_57840_30117" xmi:uuid="d8d1855a-2d4b-4146-9bd6-38f0386bada3" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>(self.Axis-&gt;size() &gt; 0) implies (self.Axis-&gt;size() = 3 and self.Position-&gt;size() = 3)</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193362_96603_24442" xmi:uuid="0d33e567-9bad-451b-accf-7a82312ed4b4" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
