        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193035_360707_23436"/>
        <body>A CartesianPoint is a type of Point. A CartesianPoint is a point that is defined by its coordinates in a rectangular Cartesian coordinate system.</body>
      </ownedComment>
