        <body>A DetailedGeometricModelItem is a type of RepresentationItem that identifies a represent a single geometric element. Each DetailedGeometricModelItem is an AxisPlacement, a CartesianTransformation, a Curve, a Direction, a Loop, a Point, a PointPath, a RotationAboutDirection, or a Surface.</body>
