        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193108_857297_23586"/>
        <body>A GeneralGeometricRepresentationRelationship is a type of GeometricRepresentationRelationship that defines a user-defined association between two GeometricModel objects whose meaning is defined by the attribute relationType. </body>
